+> **Description:** Flowise is presented in its README as a visual way to build AI agents, with a monorepo that includes a Node backend, React UI, third-party node integrations, API documentation, self-hosting guides, and multiple deployment options. In a real estate context, it works well for assembling chatbot flows that answer listing questions, route seller leads, summarize neighborhood research, and connect forms to downstream systems. **GitHub verification:** last commit date Mar 27, 2026, stars count 51.2k, primary language TypeScript, license type Apache-2.0.
