+> Best AI tools for real estate agents in 2026 are increasingly open source, self-hostable, and customizable. This list curates verified GitHub repositories that can help agents and brokerages build lead capture assistants, searchable listing knowledge bases, document pipelines, media workflows, and valuation models without depending on proprietary SaaS lock-in.
