+- **Best RAG application stack:** [LlamaIndex](https://github.com/run-llama/llama_index) plus [Qdrant](https://github.com/qdrant/qdrant) for listing, neighborhood, and policy search.
+- **Best document ingestion set:** [Docling](https://github.com/docling-project/docling), [Unstructured](https://github.com/Unstructured-IO/unstructured), and [OCRmyPDF](https://github.com/ocrmypdf/OCRmyPDF).
+- **Best listing-media stack:** [ComfyUI](https://github.com/Comfy-Org/ComfyUI), [Fooocus](https://github.com/lllyasviel/Fooocus), and [Real-ESRGAN](https://github.com/xinntao/Real-ESRGAN).
