+## Why This List
+Open source matters for real estate because the most useful AI systems usually need access to proprietary brokerage data: listing notes, transaction docs, CRM exports, neighborhood comps, photos, and call transcripts. Public GitHub repositories let agents and technical operators inspect the code, self-host the stack, control data residency, and combine multiple tools into a workflow that fits a local market.
